docs/knowledge-base/**/*.docx

# ── Derived, exported and scratch artefacts (audit 2026-07-25) ────────────────
# All of the below were untracked AND un-gitignored, i.e. one `git add -A` away
# from permanent history (~56 MB), and they made local gate runs differ from CI.
#
# Snapshot tarballs. A full-repo snapshot necessarily contains .bob/mcp.json —
# the file this .gitignore excludes because it may hold credentials — so an
# archive is a way to commit it past the rule that exists to stop that.
_to_delete/
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Obsidian/graph export output of scripts/export-kb.sh — a derived duplicate of
# docs/knowledge-base/ and never a source of truth.
kb-export/

# Second generated embedding index. `.bob/kb-index/` is already ignored above as
# generated; this sibling has the same shape and provenance (MEM-06 tracks the
# divergence) and 1.7 MB of it was previously committed, vectors.npy included.
.bob/kb-index-st/

# arXiv paper working directory (LaTeX source, built PDF, figures). Declared
# ignored rather than left undeclared; commit paper/mnemox.tex + paper/fig/*.png
# deliberately if the source should be versioned.
paper/

# Vendored IBM Bob skill packs unrelated to this project. Only the two Mnemox
# skills are tracked (knowledge-manager/, kb-optimizer-integration.md); the other
# 28 packs — Confluent/Kafka/watsonx/pptx enablement, incl. 39 ISO/ECMA .xsd
# schemas — are your local Bob environment, not this repository's content.
.bob/skills/*
!.bob/skills/knowledge-manager/
!.bob/skills/kb-optimizer-integration.md

# Editor/OS residue anywhere in the tree (a bare `.DS_Store` rule misses nested).
**/.DS_Store
